HST Office: "Mở trong HST PDF" opens HST PDF even when PDF files are set to open in HST Draw.

HST Draw's Xuất/PDF ▸ Mở trong HST PDF (org.hst.office.vi:OpenInHstPdf) loads the PDF with
HSTPdfOpenInViewer=true. The viewer's frame loader then skips Tools ▸ Options ▸ HST Office ▸ PDF Files
("Open PDF files in HST PDF"): an explicit command asks for the viewer. Headless, hidden and preview loads
still go to Draw, which they need for a model.

- xmlsecurity hstpdf PdfViewerFrameLoader::openInDraw: the HSTPdfOpenInViewer load argument.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
